{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/6061a008f81989afeb011d58b0a3b3075ec74181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right) + 3\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right) + 4\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\right) + \\cdots + 10\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{10}\\right)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"477\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11e85a1f05fdd4de571a02bcd7553ba950c60bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 45 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 49 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 54 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the first product, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb15b2b5f5c1ca3bc861352ef4e95a364441036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"110\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/6/fd62404e40c34f7950dd7db82ef87924fb6649a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\times2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Looking at the second, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70c462d4086703ed9bf5126a8e567154b8a44dbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"106\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/0/7b0b351254b46e8102d3ec8fea01a0c671ba6169.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}\\times3=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We seem to be going up by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Just to check,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8aaebe207f2c46c4841ad219fc5651907de220b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{n-1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"115\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/5/e15451bea05a8a6c3cdbfde7ecb72952ded90bea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n-1}{n}\\times n=n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"144\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Now that we have discovered the pattern, we have to find the last term.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f66e02fb3274d1b00514c938f2abb869d53cc169.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-\\frac{1}{10}=\\frac{9}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76bf5f144439fdf5b931c7dd8ac19eb89381ee76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{10}\\times10=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The sum of all numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4af3371abea751decb48e4a0f2a4835e803430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9\\cdot10}{2}=45=\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>